    U["Creator (Studio) · Buyer (Market) · Judge (Walkthrough)<br/>one Cloud Run URL — HMAC-authenticated API, or isolated public sandbox"]:::surface
    GW["AGENT GATEWAY<br/>every call: identity → role → policy<br/>denials are structured events, never silent"]:::gate
    ORCH["ADK registry + supervisor<br/>role-scoped discovery · deadlines · leases<br/>quarantine + reroute on a hung worker"]:::agents
    FLEET["Four conflict-domain agents (+ deterministic arbiter)<br/>custodian ∥ negotiator ∥ evidence ∥ revocation<br/>one service account each — no SA holds two domains"]:::agents
    DATA["Firestore: per-domain databases (IAM-conditioned)<br/>+ append-only grant-event log (create-only IAM)<br/>state = a fold over events, at any timestamp"]:::data
    CLOUD["Gemini 3.5 · Vertex AI — interprets, never decides<br/>Cloud KMS — signs notices, verifiable by anyone<br/>Cloud Trace — one correlated trace per delegation"]:::cloud

    U --> GW --> ORCH --> FLEET --> DATA
    FLEET --> CLOUD
